2026-11-06T03:09:01.7709482Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7811275Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7819546Z [0m
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7820305Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7821478Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7821941Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7822344Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7823536Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7824270Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7824608Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7825569Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7825934Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7827157Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7828155Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7828810Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7829328Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7829783Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7830061Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7830427Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7830765Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7831544Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7831739Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7831949Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7832171Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7832557Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7833151Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7833853Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7834059Z I will:
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7834699Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7835122Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7835957Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7836680Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7837269Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7837878Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7838290Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7838812Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7839353Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7852648Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7854020Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7864622Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7865341Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:09:01.7865785Z 
